# LangGraph Runtime Inmem

The Python in-memory runtime, used only with `FF_INMEM_CORE=false`. `langgraph-api` runs the in-memory runtime on Go core; this package depends on `langgraph-api[inmem]` so older `langgraph-cli[inmem]` installs pick that up.
